{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/gameplaygif.gif?t=1749416412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play casual runs lasting an average of 20 minutes, exploring 6 distinct maps and facing over 100 unique monster types. Play with 60 different spells, choose between 6 playable characters, and face 12 challenging bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR ELEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose an initial element between fire, water, poison, electric, earth, ice, which will define your trajectory based on it, but you will still be able to use the other elements when you unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/choose_element_en.png?t=1749416412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive and battle 12 different bosses with unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/frog_gif.gif?t=1749416412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>COLLECT SPELLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect 60 unique elemental spells through monster drops, choose and upgrade them in the portal room to make your next attempts easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/gif_post2.gif?t=1749416412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FRIENDS LEADERBOARD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with your friends to see who does the most damage and finishes the maps and minigames the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/leaderboard_en.gif?t=1749416412\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3499910?t=1749416412","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749416412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/7a4d057657b19a711d39b915cbc0ac61007db6d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749416412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/7a4d057657b19a711d39b915cbc0ac61007db6d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749416412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3615540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/gameplaygif.gif?t=1749416412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play casual runs lasting an average of 20 minutes, exploring 6 distinct maps and facing over 100 unique monster types. Play with 60 different spells, choose between 6 playable characters, and face 12 challenging bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHOOSE YOUR ELEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose an initial element between fire, water, poison, electric, earth, ice, which will define your trajectory based on it, but you will still be able to use the other elements when you unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3499910/extras/choose_element_en.png?t=1749416412\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"